# Changelog

How this workspace's deliverable changed over time, for human readers.
Format: [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/), with dates
instead of version numbers. **Newest entry on top.** One entry per work session,
using only the headings that apply:

- **Added**: new results, figures, sections, analyses
- **Changed**: revised conclusions, reworked figures or text, template updates
- **Fixed**: corrected errors
- **Removed**: dropped content

Template updates get one line under Changed, e.g. `Template 1.0.0 → 1.1.0 (see
agent-workspace-template CHANGELOG)`. Agent handoff notes go in `TASK.md` → Handoff, not here.

